      "source": "SG-51",
      "text": "# SG-51: Fonts Status: ACTIVE Category: Typography Team websites use the system font of the device. No web fonts. - The body font MUST be declared starting with `system-ui`: `font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif;` - Code snippets use `ui-monospace, \"SF Mono\", Consolas, monospace`. - Don't load fonts from Google Fonts or other services, see the single-file delivery document."
    },
    {
      "source": "SG-14",
      "text": "# SG-14: Accent color Status: ACTIVE Category: Color Team websites use exactly one accent color: `#E4007C` (UPB magenta). - The accent MUST be defined once as a CSS custom property named `--accent`, for example `:root { --accent: #E4007C; }`. - The accent is the same in day and night mode. - Use it only for: hot take badges, links, the focus outline and small highlights. - Don't use the accent for large backgrounds or body text."
    },
    {
      "source": "SG-01",
      "text": "# SG-01: Glossary Status: ACTIVE Category: Meta - **Team website**: the single HTML file that introduces one lab group. - **Member card**: the block that introduces one team member. - **Hot take**: a short, provocative opinion of a team member about AI. - **Theme**: the visual mode of the page, either day (light) or night (dark). - **Accent**: the one highlight color used for emphasis. - **Breakpoint**: the viewport width at which the layout switches between mobile and desktop. - **Data URI**: a way to embed a file (for example an image) directly inside the HTML. - **Reduced motion**: a user setting in the operating system asking websites to minimise animation."
    }
