          <p class="bio">Aniket is pursuing an M.Sc. in Computer Science at Paderborn University after earning a bachelor's degree in Computer Engineering from Savitribai Phule Pune University. He enjoys travelling and cooking, alongside a long list of creative and active pursuits. A theatre skit once earned him an award at an Asia-level national competition. Aniket sees AI as a useful assistant for coding, debugging and learning, but believes developers must understand and verify its output rather than depend on it blindly.</p>
